      "text": "$1.5M WORTH OF COCAINE, SMUGGLERS, &ILLEGAL ALIENS FOUND IN A MOBILE HOME!\n\n7/30- USBP and Texas DPS disrupted a stash house and drug distribution hub operating out of a mobile home in Mission, TX. In the home, authorities discovered:\n\n*Two smugglers who were illegally present in the U.S.\n*Three additional illegal aliens waiting to be smuggled further into the U.S.\n*Multiple wooden boxes containing 48 lbs. of cocaine\n\nThe primary smuggler will face charges for felony illegal re-entry, while the others, citizens of Nepal, El Salvador, and Guatemala, will be processed for removal. Our agents play a crucial role in shutting down these criminal networks.",
